OL,3,GNEWSAReform accused of trying to start
OL,4,Arace row over Pakistan flag
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform has been accused by a Tory
OL,7,Fpolitician of trying to start a race
OL,8,Frow after a senior MP attacked Cardiff
OL,9,Fcouncil for flying a Pakistan flag over
OL,10,Fthe city's castle.
OL,12,FThe local authority said it flew the
OL,13,Fflag for two days in August this year
OL,14,Fto mark the country's Independence Day.
OL,16,FSocial media accounts for Robert
OL,17,FJenrick, Reform UK's economic
OL,18,Fspokesman, said the act of flying the
OL,19,Fflag was an "attempt to dominate our
OL,20,Fculture".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
